 ['Funannotate2 26.2.12; gfftk 26.2.12; buscolite 26.1.26; annorefine 2026.2.22; inspected miniprot <code>--outn=4 -G3000 --gff-only -t2</code>','MCA10 prediction completed October 30: 31,847,357 bp, 335 contigs, N50 1,048,996, 11,013 genes and 10,856 mRNAs.','Embedded BUSCO 1,109/1,122 complete (98.84%) supports that annotation only; it does not certify all annotations or replacement of older inputs. Intron limit/model sensitivity deserves checking for missed genes.'],
